Dhèwèké nggawe terobosan internasional minangka Cleo Cazo ing film DC &lt;a href="The%20Suicide%20Squad"&gt;The Suicide Squad&lt;/a&gt; (2021), sing entuk dhèwèké nominasi Pendatang Anyar Paling Apik ing Golden Globes Portugis. Sabanjure, dhèwèké njupuk peran cilik ing film basa Inggris, kalebu &lt;a href="Marlowe"&gt;Marlowe&lt;/a&gt; (2022), &lt;a href="Assassin%20Club"&gt;Assassin Club&lt;/a&gt; (2023), &lt;a href="Guardians%20of%20the%20Galaxy%20Vol.%203"&gt;Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 3&lt;/a&gt; (2023) lan &lt;a href="Fast%20X"&gt;Fast X&lt;/a&gt; (2023).
