Asu prairie (genus Cynomys) iku bajing herbivora sing asalé saka suket ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Lor"&gt;Amérika Lor&lt;/a&gt;. Ing genus ana limang spesies: &lt;a href="Buntut%20ireng%20asu%20prairie"&gt;buntut ireng&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Buntut%20putih%20asu%20prairie"&gt;buntut putih&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gunnison%27s%20asu%20prairie"&gt;Gunnison's&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Utah%20asu%20prairie"&gt;Utah&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="asu%20prairie%20Meksiko"&gt;asu prairie Meksiko&lt;/a&gt;. Ing Meksiko, asu prairie ditemokake utamane ing negara bagian lor, sing dumunung ing ujung kidul Great Plains: &lt;a href="Sonora"&gt;Sonora&lt;/a&gt; sisih lor, &lt;a href="Chihuahua"&gt;Chihuahua&lt;/a&gt; lor lan lor, &lt;a href="Coahuila"&gt;Coahuila&lt;/a&gt; lor, &lt;a href="Nuevo%20Le%C3%B3n"&gt;Nuevo León&lt;/a&gt; lor, lan &lt;a href="Tamaulipas"&gt;Tamaulipas&lt;/a&gt; lor. Ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, utamane ing sisih kulon &lt;a href="Kali%20Mississippi"&gt;Kali Mississippi&lt;/a&gt;, sanajan uga dikenalake ing sawetara wilayah wétan.

