<doc id="195369" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=195369" title="The Godfather">
The Godfather

The Godfather, ingkang dipunarahaken déning &lt;a href="Francis%20Ford%20Coppola"&gt;Francis Ford Coppola&lt;/a&gt; lan dipunserat bebarengan kaliyan &lt;a href="Mario%20Puzo"&gt;Mario Puzo&lt;/a&gt;, minangka filem gangster epik Amerika ingkang dipunbabar ing warsa 1972 lan adhedhasar ing novel paling larisipun Puzo ingkang dipunbabar ing warsa 1969. Filem punika ngampilaken aktor-aktor kondhang kados &lt;a href="Marlon%20Brando"&gt;Marlon Brando&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Al%20Pacino"&gt;Al Pacino&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="James%20Caan"&gt;James Caan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Richard%20Castellano"&gt;Richard Castellano&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Robert%20Duvall"&gt;Robert Duvall&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sterling%20Hayden"&gt;Sterling Hayden&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="John%20Marley"&gt;John Marley&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Richard%20Conte"&gt;Richard Conte&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Diane%20Keaton"&gt;Diane Keaton&lt;/a&gt;. Minangka bagéyan sepisanan saking trilogi The Godfather, filem punika nyariosaken babagan kulawarga Corleone ingkang dipunpimpin déning Vito Corleone wiwit taun 1945 dumugi 1955. Crita punika nyorot perjalananipun Michael Corleone saking tiyang ingkang kirang gelem melu dumugi dados bos &lt;a href="mafia"&gt;mafia&lt;/a&gt; ingkang kejem.
The Godfather dipunparingi ganjaran minangka salah satunggaling filem paling agung lan paling nggadhahi pengaruh ing sejarah, ugi minangka tonggak penting ing genre gangster. Ing warsa 1990, filem punika dipuntambahaken dhateng &lt;a href="National%20Film%20Registry"&gt;National Film Registry&lt;/a&gt; amargi pentingipun saking segi budaya, sejarah, utawi estetika lan dados filem Amerika ingkang kaping kalih paling agung miturut Institut Film Amerika, sawisé &lt;a href="Citizen%20Kane"&gt;Citizen Kane&lt;/a&gt;. Sekuel-sekuelipun kalebet &lt;a href="The%20Godfather%20Part%20II"&gt;The Godfather Part II&lt;/a&gt; ing warsa 1974 lan &lt;a href="The%20Godfather%20Part%20III"&gt;The Godfather Part III&lt;/a&gt; ing warsa 1990. &lt;a href="Pauline%20Kae"&gt;Pauline Kae&lt;/a&gt;l muji The Godfather minangka conto utama saking gabungan suksesipun komersialisasi lan seni ing filem-filem populèr.
